@startuml
title Class status | FR-005/007/020 | BR-042–047
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam activityBorderColor #475569
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #475569
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam stateBorderColor #475569
state "Published" as published
state "In progress" as progress
state "Completed" as completed
state "Cancelled" as cancelled
[*] --> published : Eligible Teacher creates and publishes the class
published --> progress : Teacher starts the class
published --> completed : Completion is recorded or scheduled end is processed
progress --> completed : Completion is recorded or scheduled end is processed
published --> cancelled : Teacher cancellation or recorded no-show
progress --> cancelled : Cancellation is recorded
completed --> cancelled : Current backend also permits cancellation after completion
cancelled --> [*]
state "Full (accepted by backend)" as full
full --> progress : Teacher starts the class
full --> completed : Completion is recorded or scheduled end is processed
full --> cancelled : Teacher cancellation or recorded no-show
note right of full
 No automatic change from Published to Full is implemented.
 Seat availability is still checked when booking.
end note
note left of published
 A Draft status is named in code.
 Current creation publishes directly, with no draft step.
end note
note right of completed
 Completion records its time and reason.
 Current backend allows later cancellation,
 although the domain rules treat Completed as final.
 Income release is processed in the background.
end note
@enduml
